cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this double-ball balance extension or its HIL results, please
  cite this repository and the relevant upstream work listed below.
type: software
title: Microduck Double Balance
abstract: >-
  A double-ball balancing extension of Microduck Playground, with PPO
  training and measured 50 Hz PC-Jetson simulation hardware-in-the-loop
  execution using native MuJoCo and a frozen FP32 ONNX policy.
authors:
  - name: liuxue-lab
repository-code: https://github.com/liuxue-lab/microduck-double-balance
url: https://github.com/liuxue-lab/microduck-double-balance/tree/double-balance
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - Microduck
  - robotics
  - reinforcement learning
  - hardware-in-the-loop
  - MuJoCo
  - ONNX
references:
